1. Battery Pass Data Model, version 1.2.0
   by the BatteryPass project consortium
   https://github.com/batterypass/BatteryPassDataModel
   (commit 7f4091810d56ad4cd031897d58dd5e438b4d979f)

   Used in app/lib/aas_view/battery_pass_1_2_0.json, extracted from the AAS
   files of the seven submodels: the identifiers (idShort, semanticId), the
   element structure, the data types, the units and the value lists. The
   descriptions, definitions and example values of the model are not taken
   over. Changed: arranged in a JSON file of its own (rake task
   dpp:aas:extract_battery_pass); two units the AAS files leave out are taken
   from the SAMM aspect model of the same release
   (app/lib/aas_view/battery_pass_1_2_0.yml, model_units).

2. IDTA 02099-1 Digital Product Passport, Part 1 (submodel template
   DppMetadata), version 1.0
   by the Industrial Digital Twin Association (IDTA)
   https://github.com/admin-shell-io/submodel-templates

   Used in app/lib/aas_view.rb (AasView::Metadata): the semantic identifiers
   and idShorts of the submodel and its elements. Nothing else is taken over.
